ermination of pregnancy: with data capture to monitor prevalence of infection</article-title><source>Sex Transm Infect</source><year>2002</year><volume>78</volume><fpage>416</fpage><lpage>421</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12473801</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/sti.78.6.416</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Matteelli</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Beltrame</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Carvalho</surname><given-names>AC</given-names></name><name><surname>Casalini</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Forleo</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Gulletta</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>Chlamydia trachomatis genital infection in migrant female sex workers in Italy</article-title><source>Int J STD AIDS</source><year>2003</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>591</fpage><lpage>595</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14511494</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1258/095646203322301031</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>SIT</collab></person-group><article-title>Pour mettre au jour l'&#x000e9;conomie de l'ombre</article-title><source>Syndicat interprofessionnel de travailleuses et travailleurs, Gen&#x000e8;ve</source><year>2003</year></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>